    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Entella</span></b> , ae, f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔντελλα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city</i> in the interior <i>of Sicily</i>, now <i>Rocca d'
			Entella</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 14, 204</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Entellīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Entella</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 8,
				14, § 91</span></i>.—In sing.,
			Entellinus, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 87</span></i>.—And
				adj.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Entellinus senatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i>
			</div>
